/v1/","context":{"app_id":4857730,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4857730-1846018067941794","game_id":"steam-4857730","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest Demo — LIVE NOW!","summary":"Hello Runners,The Rifted Skies Steam Next Fest Demo is now available! It's time to jump in, do some parkour, and slice some enemies coming from the Rift. Please let us know if you have any feedback or come across any issues - we will be monitoring the Steam Discussions and our Discord all day!Enjoy and watch out for The Rift!Follow our socials and join our Discord below to keep yourself updated on everything related to The Rifted Skies!Discord YouTube Twitter TikTok","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T17:20:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941794","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4857730-1845383656394096","game_id":"steam-4857730","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the Demo before Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey everyone, we have an exciting announcement today!As you might know, we will be participating in the Steam Next Fest, but you won't have to wait until the Next Fest starts! We are opening the gates on October 12th for everyone.Our Next Fest demo will be playable between October 12th - October 26th, so you will be able to start playing a week before the Next Fest starts - that means you will be able to parkour around for more!Demo StartsDemo EndsOctober 12thOctober 26th Check out the Demo page","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T17:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394096","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4857730-1842212951300758","game_id":"steam-4857730","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Breakdown — Learnings & Changes","summary":"Hello everyone, and a special shoutout to those who participated in our recent playtest!We're back with an update on how it went, as well as to demonstrate how much we value the feedback from our playtesters. But before we go into any details, let's give you some exciting news first!🏹Get Ready for Steam Next Fest!So, we hear that you're asking what's next for us? We are getting ready for our Steam Next Fest Demo! You will be able to experience almost all the changes we're going to discuss below,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T17:00:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300758","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4857730-1839676055897947","game_id":"steam-4857730","kind":"announcement","title":"Apply for Closed Playtest — August 6th!","summary":"Hey everyone, welcome to another devlog! You probably heard about our upcoming playtest - if not, make sure to join our Discord to get the latest development news, teasers, and more! So today, we would like to talk more about it and give you some insight.📢 Playtest on August 6th & Steam Next FestWe're planning to hold our next playtest on August 6th! It will be a Closed Playtest, and you can already apply for it via a Google Form. We will also be participating in the upcoming Steam Next Fest! Yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T17:00:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055897947","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4857730-1836506165571197","game_id":"steam-4857730","kind":"announcement","title":"Behind the Rift — Devlog #1","summary":"Hey everyone, Last week, we revealed our debut game, The Rifted Skies, a parkour VR roguelite game. We've seen your first impressions and couldn't be happier with your enthusiasm - thank you so much! ❤️ We wanted to dig a little bit deeper into the game, talking about the story and what to expect during your runs. Uncover the MysteryThe protagonist is a descendant of the spiritual guardians of a mountain tribe who protected the Sanctuary and stood against the Rift for centuries. As a child, he w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T18:00:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165571197","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4857730-1835871199316513","game_id":"steam-4857730","kind":"announcement","title":"The Rifted Skies | Coming Fall 2026","summary":"The Rift is coming. A long-abandoned world. A deadly, chasing Rift. High-octane physical parkour. Can your home ever be saved? Mark your calendars, The Rifted Skies coming this Fall on Steam! Watch the reveal trailer below.In The Rifted Skies, your movement skills are key. Your muscles will ache, you'll sweat, and you'll get swamped with enemies as the Rift constantly chases you. Will you uncover the mystery in your home, or will you die trying? Follow our socials and join our Discord below to k","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T19:04:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199316513","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses